# Harta: Bind - Spike Rush (Attacker side)

MAPBG data/images/bind_spawn.png
START spawn

NODE spawn start "Bind attacker spawn. No mid on this map - A or B, plus the teleporters. Where do you commit?"
BG spawn data/images/bind_spawn.png
CHOICE spawn a "Push A through showers" a_showers
CHOICE spawn b "Push B through hookah" b_hookah
CHOICE spawn t "Send one player through the teleporter" teleport ROTATE

NODE a_showers start "A showers approach. Tight corridor - info says a Raze lurks inside with a satchel ready."
BG a_showers data/images/bind_a.png
CHOICE a_showers f "Breach flashes and team pushes" a_flash
CHOICE a_showers b "Try to get the pick" a_boost
CHOICE a_showers r "Rotate B - showers is too risky" b_hookah TEAM_IGNORED

NODE a_flash start "Your Breach flashes showers perfectly. Raze is blinded. Team pushes through uncontested."
BG a_flash data/images/bind_a.png
CHOICE a_flash p "Straight rush to A default - plant fast" a_plant
CHOICE a_flash s "Omen smokes CT and team sets up for post" a_setup

NODE a_plant win "Fast plant under flash cover. Defenders cannot get back in time through showers. Round won."
BG a_plant data/images/bind_a.png
TERMINAL a_plant win

NODE a_setup win "Controlled site take. Smokes cut off the CT angle. Clean plant. Defenders cannot defuse safely."
BG a_setup data/images/bind_a.png
TERMINAL a_setup win

NODE a_boost spike_dropped "You and your teammate push Raze. She manages to get your teammate but you trade them. Your teammate had the spike, which is now dropped in showers with more enemies rushing to hold it."
BG a_boost data/images/bind_a.png
CHOICE a_boost g "Make a run for it" a_plant SPIKE_DROPPED
CHOICE a_boost h "Hold outside and wait for another angle" a_flash

NODE b_hookah start "B hookah approach. Enemy has a one-way smoke set on hookah. You cannot see through it."
BG b_hookah data/images/bind_b.png
CHOICE b_hookah s "Omen smokes off hookah and team rushes" b_clear
CHOICE b_hookah p "Peek aggressively through the smoke" b_peek TEAM_IGNORED
CHOICE b_hookah r "Use the teleporter to rotate to A" teleport ROTATE

NODE b_clear start "Smokes block the hookah angle completely. Your team rushes B site clean with no info for defenders."
BG b_clear data/images/bind_b.png
CHOICE b_clear p "Plant on B default" b_plant
CHOICE b_clear c "Plant on B corner near the box" b_plant

NODE b_plant win "Clean B execute. Spike planted. Enemies forced to push into your crossfire. Round won."
BG b_plant data/images/bind_b.png
TERMINAL b_plant win

NODE b_peek team_ignored "Your teammates do not follow the peek. You are alone on site. 2v1 retake destroys you."
BG b_peek data/images/bind_b.png
TERMINAL b_peek lose

NODE teleport rotate "One player goes through the teleporter. The loud sound is heard - defenders rotate immediately."
BG teleport data/images/bind_spawn.png
CHOICE teleport a "Execute A before the rotation arrives" a_flash
CHOICE teleport b "It was a fake - full team pushes B" b_clear
CHOICE teleport w "Hold the teleporter and let team push A" a_plant
